1
00:00:01,060 --> 00:00:08,920
Longer, shorter

2
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:20,900
Example: Look at the picture and tell which object is longer, which is shorter?

3
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:30,430
The orange paper strip is longer than the purple paper strip.

4
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:40,450
The purple paper strip is shorter than the orange paper strip.

5
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:52,130
Pencil A is longer than pencil B.

6
00:00:54,110 --> 00:01:00,960
Pencil B is shorter than pencil A.

7
00:01:05,970 --> 00:01:13,860
Ruler A is shorter than ruler B.

8
00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:22,960
Ruler B is longer than ruler A.

